type: two-column-list
title: Tech Stack

- Frontend: React with TypeScript and Vite for fast local dev
- Backend: Node.js with Express and structured logging
- Database: PostgreSQL with connection pooling via pgBouncer
- Auth: Passkeys and OAuth 2.0 with short-lived JWT sessions
- Deploy: PM2 cluster mode behind nginx with health checks
- Observability: OpenTelemetry traces exported to Grafana Tempo
